true,"evidence_locator":"pp. 10–11 documents vampire mining, treasury control changes, governance crises, leadership conflict, and the failed Frog Nation governance route.","evidence_scope":"governance_and_causal_context","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"codex-research-agent","access_state":"accessible","access_checked_at":"2026-07-29","access_http_status":200,"access_method":"direct_http_retrieval","verification_note":"Direct retrieval returned HTTP 200 and the stated locator was editorially inspected. pp. 10–11 documents vampire mining, treasury control changes, governance crises, leadership conflict, and the failed Frog Nation governance route."},{"id":"sushi-coindesk-kanpai","title":"DeFi Protocol SushiSwap Proposes ''Immediate'' Action to Support Its Treasury","publisher":"CoinDesk","url":"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2022/12/07/defi-protocol-sushi-proposes-immediate-action-to-support-its-treasury","source_tier":"T3","source_role":"independent","resolving":true,"evidence_reviewed":true,"evidence_locator":"Reports the treasury deficit, approximately 18 months of runway, and proposal to divert 100% of platform fees to the treasury multisig.","evidence_scope":"treasury_event","independence_group":"sushiswap-kanpai-proposal-2022-12","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"codex-research-agent","access_state":"accessible","access_checked_at":"2026-07-29","access_http_status":200,"access_method":"direct_http_retrieval","verification_note":"Direct retrieval returned HTTP 200 and the stated locator was editorially inspected. Reports the treasury deficit, approximately 18 months of runway, and proposal to divert 100% of platform fees to the treasury multisig."},{"id":"sushi-theblock-kanpai","title":"Sushi DAO implements proposal to direct xSUSHI revenue to treasury","publisher":"The Block","url":"https://www.theblock.co/post/204593/sushi-dao-implements-proposal-to-direct-all-trading-fees-to-treasury","source_tier":"T3","source_role":"independent","resolving":true,"evidence_reviewed":true,"evidence_locator":"Reports the implemented fee diversion, temporary one-year term, token-holder fee removal, and concentrated vote.","evidence_scope":"treasury_event_and_vote_concentration","independence_group":"sushiswap-kanpai-implementation-vote-2023-01","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"codex-research-agent","access_state":"bot_blocked_raw_fetch","access_checked_at":"2026-07-29","access_http_status":403,"access_method":"indexed_browser_retrieval","verification_note":"Direct automated retrieval returned HTTP 403; the article body and the stated locator were reviewed through an indexed browser snapshot. Reports the implemented fee diversion, temporary one-year term, token-holder fee removal, and concentrated vote."},{"id":"sushi-certik-routeprocessor2","title":"Post Mortem: Sushiswap","publisher":"CertiK","url":"https://www.certik.com/blog/post-mortem-sushiswap","source_tier":"T2","source_role":"security-research","resolving":true,"evidence_reviewed":true,"evidence_locator":"Independent incident analysis identifies the RouteProcessor2 validation defect, approximately $3.3M loss, and that the affected router was outside CertiK''s prior audit scope.","evidence_scope":"security_incident","independence_caveat":"CertiK had a prior commercial audit relationship with Sushi. Its postmortem states the affected RouteProcessor2 router was outside that audit scope; use it for incident mechanics, not as cleanly independent proof of broader causality.","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"codex-research-agent","access_state":"accessible","access_checked_at":"2026-07-29","access_http_status":200,"access_method":"direct_http_retrieval","verification