  '{"operational_model":"Base-native MetaDEX combining constant-product and concentrated-liquidity AMMs with vote-directed emissions and fee distribution","chains":["Base"],"token":{"launched":true,"symbol":"AERO","launch_date":"2023-08-28","role":"liquidity emissions; locked veAERO directs rewards and earns exchange revenue","source_url":"https://aerodrome.finance/docs"},"metrics":{"spot_volume_24h_usd":436642061,"spot_volume_30d_usd":11435960924,"spot_volume_all_time_usd":409584237311,"spot_tvl_usd":283389024,"peak_daily_spot_volume_usd":1669460340,"peak_daily_spot_volume_date":"2024-12-10","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/aerodrome?dataType=dailyVolume"},"success_factors":["base_ecosystem_alignment","liquidity_incentive_market","fee_distribution_to_voters","clean_launch","chain_dominant_position"],"risks":["single_chain_concentration","emission_dilution","governance_capture","merge_execution"],"synthesis":"The token is central to the mechanism, but the durable signal is fee-producing volume per unit of emissions.","forensic_analysis":{"version":"forensic-analysis-v1","outcome":{"label":"successful","summary":"Aerodrome is an operating Base-native DEX with substantial current activity. The research snapshot records about 11.44 billion dollars of 30-day spot volume and 283 million dollars of spot TVL. Aerodrome''s own April 2026 documentation reports more than 185 billion dollars of cumulative volume and 270 million dollars in swap fees. This is protocol success, not a conclusion that AERO emissions are costless or every pool is durable.","confidence":"high","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_refs":["https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/aerodrome?dataType=dailyVolume","https://aerodrome.finance/docs","https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/01/29/aero-dex-aims-to-fix-liquidity-fragmentation-and-dethrone-the-incumbents","https://www.theblock.co/post/378634/aerodrome-upgrades-evm-extensions-circles-arc-metadex"]},"why":{"summary":"Aerodrome paired Base distribution with a vote-directed liquidity market: weekly AERO emissions compensate staked LPs, veAERO voters direct those emissions, and voters receive the fees and incentives generated by pools they support. Constant-product and Slipstream concentrated-liquidity pools broaden the execution surface. Current activity is consistent with this flywheel establishing a chain-level liquidity hub, but the evidence cannot isolate Base growth from incentives, integrations, or design quality.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs","https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/aerodrome?dataType=dailyVolume","https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/01/29/aero-dex-aims-to-fix-liquidity-fragmentation-and-dethrone-the-incumbents","https://www.theblock.co/post/378634/aerodrome-upgrades-evm-extensions-circles-arc-metadex"]},"strategic_choices":[{"decision":"Launch as a Base-focused liquidity hub using both constant-product pools and the Slipstream concentrated-liquidity design.","consequence":"Aerodrome could meet broad and capital-efficient routing needs inside one fast-growing ecosystem, while accepting heavy dependence on Base activity and a single-chain competitive position.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs","https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/01/29/aero-dex-aims-to-fix-liquidity-fragmentation-and-dethrone-the-incumbents","https://www.theblock.co/post/378634/aerodrome-upgrades-evm-extensions-circles-arc-metadex"]},{"decision":"Separate liquid AERO emissions for LPs from locked veAERO voting power and fee rights.","consequence":"Projects can compete for directed liquidity and voters are rewarded from pool revenue and incentives. The same mechanism creates recurring dilution, bribe-market complexity, and governance-capture risk.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs"]},{"decision":"Distribute protocol-generated value to participating token operators and liquidity providers rather than retain a conventional corporate fee margin.","consequence":"Participation is closely linked to exchange economics, strengthening the flywheel while making long-term sustainability dependent on fee productivity relative to emissions and incentives.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs"]},{"decision":"Plan to merge Aerodrome and Velodrome into the cross-chain Aero system and MetaDEX03 architecture.","consequence":"A unified system could reduce ecosystem fragmentation and expand distribution beyond Base, but it introduces migration, governance, token-conversion, and execution risk into an already successful venue.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs","https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/01/29/aero-dex-aims-to-fix-liquidity-fragmentation-and-dethrone-the-incumbents","https://www.theblock.co/post/378634/aerodrome-upgrades-evm-extensions-circles-arc-metadex"]}],"counterfactual":{"summary":"Without Base-native focus and the vote-directed liquidity flywheel, Aerodrome likely would have had less ability to bootstrap deep markets quickly. A lower-emission, fee-only model might reduce dilution, but could also weaken liquidity formation before organic fees were sufficient. The net alternative outcome cannot be observed.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs","https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/aerodrome?dataType=dailyVolume","https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/01/29/aero-dex-aims-to-fix-liquidity-fragmentation-and-dethrone-the-incumbents","https://www.theblock.co/post/378634/aerodrome-upgrades-evm-extensions-circles-arc-metadex"]},"watch":[{"signal":"Thirty-day volume, TVL, fees, and Base DEX share.","implication":"Sustained fee-producing activity supports the chain-hub thesis; declining share or TVL despite emissions would show that the moat is weakening.","source_refs":["https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/aerodrome?dataType=dailyVolume"]},{"signal":"Annualized AERO emissions compared with voter revenue and liquidity depth.","implication":"Revenue and depth growing faster than dilution supports economic sustainability; the reverse indicates that token issuance is subsidizing apparent success.","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs"]},{"signal":"Aero merger milestones, contract audits, migration terms, and post-migration liquidity retention.","implication":"Orderly execution could widen the network effect; delays, incompatible incentives, or liquidity flight would weaken the outlook.","source_refs":["https://aerodrome.finance/docs"]}],"unknowns":["What portion of current liquidity would remain if AERO emissions and third-party voting incentives fell materially?","How concentrated is effective veAERO voting power after aggregators, protocol-owned locks, and delegated positions are included?","Will the Aero merger preserve Aerodrome''s Base liquidity advantage while adding other chains, or dilute operational focus?"],"review":{"status":"current","last_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","next_review_at":"2026-08-05","reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk"}}}',
  '[{"title":"Aerodrome documentation and economics","url":"https://aerodrome.finance/docs"},{"title":"Aerodrome public site","url":"https://aerodrome.finance/"},{"title":"DefiLlama Aerodrome daily-volume series","url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/aerodrome?dataType=dailyVolume"},{"id":"aerodrome-coindesk-aero","title":"Aero DEX aims to fix liquidity fragmentation and dethrone the incumbents","publisher":"CoinDesk","url":"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/01/29/aero-dex-aims-to-fix-liquidity-fragmentation-and-dethrone-the-incumbents","source_tier":"T3","source_role":"independent","resolving":true,"evidence_reviewed":true,"evidence_locator":"Reports Aerodrome''s Base position, TVL context, and the planned Aerodrome/Velodrome consolidation into Aero.","evidence_scope":"lifecycle_and_strategy_event","independence_group":"aero-project-announcement-2026-01","source_dependency":"Substantially reports the same project-announcement event as the paired The Block coverage; publisher diversity does not make the underlying causal evidence independent.","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"codex-research-agent","access_state":"accessible","access_checked_at":"2026-07-29","access_http_status":200,"access_method":"direct_http_retrieval","verification_note":"Direct retrieval returned HTTP 200 and the stated locator was editorially inspected. Reports Aerodrome''s Base position, TVL context, and the planned Aerodrome/Velodrome consolidation into Aero."},{"id":"aerodrome-theblock-aero","title":"Top Base DEX Aerodrome launches upgrade suite, expands to Ethereum and Circle''s Arc","publisher":"The Block","url":"https://www.theblock.co/post/378634/aerodrome-upgrades-evm-extensions-circles-arc-metadex","source_tier":"T3","source_role":"independent","resolving":true,"evidence_reviewed":true,"evidence_locator":"Reports Aerodrome as a successful Base DEX and describes the Aero central-liquidity-hub, merger, chain expansion, and token conversion.","evidence_scope":"lifecycle_and_strategy_event","independence_group":"aero-project-announcement-2026-01","source_dependency":"Substantially reports the same project-announcement event as the paired CoinDesk coverage; publisher diversity does not make the underlying causal evidence independent.","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"codex-research-agent","access_state":"bot_blocked_raw_fetch","access_checked_at":"2026-07-29","access_http_status":403,"access_method":"indexed_browser_retrieval","verification_note":"Direct automated retrieval returned HTTP 403; the article body and the stated locator were reviewed through an indexed browser snapshot. Reports Aerodrome as a successful Base DEX and describes the Aero central-liquidity-hub, merger, chain expansion, and token conversion."}]'
