UPDATE casino_syntheses
SET outlook = '{"as_of":"2026-07-29","product_status":"scoped Curaçao operator estate failed; current global brand not classified","legal_status":"bankruptcy final report proposed termination; scoped Curaçao licence remains revoked; claimant recovery unknown","forensic_analysis":{"version":"forensic-analysis-v1","outcome":{"label":"failed","summary":"Small House B.V.''s scoped Curaçao BC.Game operator estate failed. A court-appointed trustee''s final report records the November 12, 2024 bankruptcy order, identifies BC.Game operation as the debtor''s activity, reports an unknown balance sheet and nil closing estate balance, and proposes termination of the proceeding. The current CGA certificate still marks the named licence revoked. This does not classify the current international BC.Game brand or a successor operator as failed.","confidence":"high","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://cert.cga.cw/certificate?id=ZXlKcGRpSTZJa2x1ZEdjMVFuUTFVRzF4VERWUWJYRXpXakZaU0VFOVBTSXNJblpoYkhWbElqb2llV3BKZFhsTlRtTkJXbkZoUWpGUE9IWnZha3hpUVQwOUlpd2liV0ZqSWpvaVltVTNNVEZtTjJRek1qVXhOemt6WldVeFpHWXlNVGxtTURVM1pqSTVNemd3WldGbFpUSmtZamszTWpGa01tSTJORFU0WWpNME9EYzRNMk0zTlRJd05DSXNJblJoWnlJNklpSjk%3D","https://bc.game/press-release.pdf"]},"why":{"summary":"The evidence supports a sequence rather than a single-cause story: player-payment obligations remained disputed through an operator transfer; Small House argued that it acquired assets but not legacy liabilities; the appellate court declared the entity bankrupt; the trustee later reported no visibility into a complete balance sheet and a nil estate balance; and the Curaçao licence is now marked revoked. The international operator contested the bankruptcy narrative. The record does not establish a complete asset trail or quantify how much transfer design, operating losses, governance or regulation contributed.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://www.curacaochronicle.com/post/main/curacao-court-declares-bankruptcy-for-blockdance-and-small-house-amidst-unpaid-player-claims/","https://bc.game/press-release.pdf"]},"strategic_choices":[{"decision":"Transfer BC.Game website and software operations from Blockdance to Small House while treating legacy liabilities as outside the acquired package.","consequence":"The separation preserved a path for brand and software continuity but made creditor responsibility central to litigation; the trustee report says Small House asserted it acquired the assets while relevant liabilities remained with Blockdance.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://www.curacaochronicle.com/post/main/curacao-court-declares-bankruptcy-for-blockdance-and-small-house-amidst-unpaid-player-claims/"]},{"decision":"Continue international brand operations while contesting the Curaçao estate''s implications.","consequence":"Brand continuity became separable from the failure of one legal operator and licence. That preserves an operating claim outside Curaçao but makes entity, custody and liability mapping essential before drawing a global conclusion.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://bc.game/press-release.pdf","https://cert.cga.cw/certificate?id=ZXlKcGRpSTZJa2x1ZEdjMVFuUTFVRzF4VERWUWJYRXpXakZaU0VFOVBTSXNJblpoYkhWbElqb2llV3BKZFhsTlRtTkJXbkZoUWpGUE9IWnZha3hpUVQwOUlpd2liV0ZqSWpvaVltVTNNVEZtTjJRek1qVXhOemt6WldVeFpHWXlNVGxtTURVM1pqSTVNemd3WldGbFpUSmtZamszTWpGa01tSTJORFU0WWpNME9EYzRNMk0zTlRJd05DSXNJblJoWnlJNklpSjk%3D"]}],"counterfactual":{"summary":"Segregated player funds, a court- and regulator-visible asset register, and an explicitly funded assumption or exclusion of every player liability during transfer would have reduced ambiguity and creditor risk. The trustee''s inability to establish a complete balance sheet shows why those controls matter, but the public record cannot prove that they would have made the product profitable or prevented every claim.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://www.curacaochronicle.com/post/main/curacao-court-declares-bankruptcy-for-blockdance-and-small-house-amidst-unpaid-player-claims/"]},"watch":[{"signal":"A court order terminating the Small House bankruptcy and any final creditor distribution schedule.","implication":"These records will determine realized recovery; a nil estate balance is not itself a claimant-level distribution result.","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf"]},{"signal":"CGA certificate or enforcement-register changes for OGL/2023/118/0060.","implication":"A status change would update the scoped licence record but would not identify a successor''s operator, custody or liabilities.","source_refs":["https://cert.cga.cw/certificate?id=ZXlKcGRpSTZJa2x1ZEdjMVFuUTFVRzF4VERWUWJYRXpXakZaU0VFOVBTSXNJblpoYkhWbElqb2llV3BKZFhsTlRtTkJXbkZoUWpGUE9IWnZha3hpUVQwOUlpd2liV0ZqSWpvaVltVTNNVEZtTjJRek1qVXhOemt6WldVeFpHWXlNVGxtTURVM1pqSTVNemd3WldGbFpUSmtZamszTWpGa01tSTJORFU0WWpNME9EYzRNMk0zTlRJd05DSXNJblJoWnlJNklpSjk%3D"]},{"signal":"Current BC.Game terms naming the international operator, licences, custody path and treatment of legacy balances.","implication":"Direct evidence is required before connecting the failed Curaçao estate to the current global product.","source_refs":["https://bc.game/press-release.pdf"]}],"unknowns":["What distribution, if any, did each recognized creditor receive before termination?","What assets and player liabilities moved from Blockdance to Small House, and under which enforceable agreements?","Who is the current international operator, where are customer assets held, and what relationship does it have to Small House?","Did the court grant the trustee''s proposal to terminate the bankruptcy, and on what final estate accounting?"],"review":{"status":"current","last_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","next_review_at":"2026-08-05","reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk"}}}',
    reviewed_at = '2026-07-29'
WHERE case_id = 'bc-game-curacao-small-house';

UPDATE casino_syntheses
SET outlook = '{"as_of":"2026-07-29","product_status":"superseded","scope_guard":"Do not classify company, token or residual endpoints as failed.","forensic_analysis":{"version":"forensic-analysis-v1","outcome":{"label":"failed","summary":"The original FunFair B2B casino-platform thesis is no longer the current product represented at funfair.io, which now resolves to a venture-capital business. This is a scoped product failure: FunFair Technologies Ltd remains active, FUNToken continues separately, and some legacy network endpoints still respond.","confidence":"medium","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_refs":["https://www.funfair.ventures/","https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/09743025","https://funtoken.gitbook.io/funtoken-gitbook","https://status.funfair.io/"]},"why":{"summary":"FunFair funded and licensed a technically distinctive Ethereum state-channel platform, but the reviewed current surfaces no longer market that B2B casino product. The evidence supports discontinuity and organizational pivot; it does not isolate whether operator adoption, Ethereum economics, regulation, execution, competition, or another factor dominated.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://medium.com/@aerobatic/funfair-company-update-aug-31st-72662f7576b2","https://iomdfenterprise.im/news-events/token-based-technology-provider-funfair-welcomed-by-blockchain-isle-of-man/","https://www.funfair.ventures/"]},"strategic_choices":[{"decision":"Build a regulated B2B casino stack around proprietary Ethereum Fate Channels and FUN-denominated flows.","consequence":"The design reduced per-bet on-chain interaction and won a historical supplier licence, but concentrated the product thesis on a bespoke stack and operator adoption.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://medium.com/@aerobatic/funfair-company-update-aug-31st-72662f7576b2","https://iomdfenterprise.im/news-events/token-based-technology-provider-funfair-welcomed-by-blockchain-isle-of-man/"]},{"decision":"Leave direct worldwide consumer marketing to licensed operators rather than make FunFair the casino operator.","consequence":"The company limited direct regulatory exposure but depended on third parties and white-label brands to distribute the technology.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://medium.com/@aerobatic/funfair-company-update-aug-31st-72662f7576b2"]},{"decision":"Redirect the current FunFair-branded surface toward venture capital and advisory.","consequence":"Capital and expertise could be reused in Web3, but the original casino-platform proposition ceased to be the brand''s public product.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://www.funfair.ventures/"]}],"counterfactual":{"summary":"A chain-agnostic architecture, wider operator distribution, or earlier migration away from Ethereum-specific transaction constraints might have improved the original platform''s survival odds, but no reviewed source proves that any one change would have created sustainable operator demand.","confidence":"low","source_refs":["https://medium.com/@aerobatic/funfair-company-update-aug-31st-72662f7576b2","https://status.funfair.io/"]},"watch":[{"signal":"Any first-party revival of the Fate Channels casino platform or new operator deployments.","implication":"A verified relaunch would require reclassifying the product from superseded.","source_refs":["https://www.funfair.ventures/","https://status.funfair.io/"]},{"signal":"FUNToken products, contracts and governance under the successor ecosystem.","implication":"Token activity shows successor continuity but should not be counted as evidence that the original B2B platform survived.","source_refs":["https://funtoken.gitbook.io/funtoken-gitbook"]},{"signal":"Companies House status and any Isle of Man licence-register evidence.","implication":"These resolve legal-entity and licence questions without changing product status by themselves.","source_refs":["https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/09743025","https://iomdfenterprise.im/news-events/token-based-technology-provider-funfair-welcomed-by-blockchain-isle-of-man/"]}],"unknowns":["When did the original B2B platform cease accepting new operators or processing casino sessions?","How many unaffiliated operators reached sustained production activity?","What is the current status of the historical Isle of Man supplier licence?","How much of the pivot was caused by chain economics versus adoption, regulation, competition, or internal capital allocation?"],"review":{"status":"current","last_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","next_review_at":"2026-10-27","reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk"}}}',
    reviewed_at = '2026-07-29'
WHERE case_id = 'funfair-b2b-platform';

UPDATE casino_syntheses
SET outlook = '{"as_of":"2026-07-29","watch":["Comparable activity or fee series with scope","Any primary licence or jurisdictional-status document for this exact product surface"],"forensic_analysis":{"version":"forensic-analysis-v1","outcome":{"label":"unclassified","summary":"The latest reviewed Poker Arcade-specific terms, dated June 30, 2024, identify BAG Limited, LTD and describe a free-to-play peer-to-peer poker simulation using autonomously deployed contracts on Polygon. A separate disclaimer says no regulatory authority examined or approved the information. Those sources establish the historical product, operator, chain, and legal-scope boundary; they do not establish operation in 2026, active tables, repeat players, sustainable rewards, or product economics. The current operating and commercial outcomes are therefore explicitly unclassified.","confidence":"high","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_refs":["https://docs.decentral.games/legal/terms-of-use","https://docs.decentral.games/legal/disclaimer"]},"why":{"summary":"Poker Arcade chose a narrow free-to-play, peer-to-peer poker product with user-controlled keys and autonomously deployed Polygon contracts. That design can reduce operator custody and use a lower-cost chain for repeated game actions, but poker still requires concurrent players, active tables, fair game mechanics, usable onboarding, and sustained distribution. The product-specific evidence is more than two years old at review time and supplies no current activity series. The dominant analytical fact is therefore evidence decay: a historical contract surface cannot support a current success, failure, or even active-status claim. The named BVI operator and disclaimer improve attribution but do not demonstrate a gaming licence or jurisdictional availability.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://docs.decentral.games/legal/terms-of-use","https://docs.decentral.games/legal/disclaimer"]},"strategic_choices":[{"decision":"Scope the product as a peer-to-peer Poker Arcade rather than a general casino balance or house-banked game.","consequence":"The product can focus on social poker and player-versus-player liquidity, while becoming especially sensitive to simultaneous player density and table availability.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://docs.decentral.games/legal/terms-of-use"]},{"decision":"Use autonomously deployed Polygon contracts and place private-key responsibility with users.","consequence":"The operator reduces direct wallet custody and can use lower-cost execution, while users retain key-management risk and the product depends on Polygon, contracts, and accessible interfaces.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://docs.decentral.games/legal/terms-of-use"]},{"decision":"Publish product-specific BAG Limited terms with BVI governing law and unlawful-use restrictions.","consequence":"The operator and contractual scope are attributable, but governing-law language and use restrictions do not establish a gaming licence or legality for every user.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://docs.decentral.games/legal/terms-of-use"]},{"decision":"Make Poker Arcade free-to-play and use Badges and arcade-style prizes to encourage daily play and competition.","consequence":"The design avoids presenting the cited game as house-banked real-money poker, while making retention depend on gameplay, social competition, and reward utility that current evidence does not measure.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://docs.decentral.games/legal/terms-of-use"]}],"counterfactual":{"summary":"A custodial poker room could abstract wallets and concentrate account liquidity, but would add operator custody and withdrawal risk. A real-money or broader casino could create clearer direct monetization and cross-sell, while adding regulatory exposure and diluting the narrow free-to-play poker identity. Most importantly, current signed releases, current interface evidence, or reproducible contract activity 