mmission.gov.uk/news/article/consumer-information-notice-stake-leaving-gb-market"]},{"decision":"Invest in proprietary, rapid-cycle Stake Originals alongside third-party casino content.","consequence":"A differentiated, high-frequency game catalogue supports repeat play and extremely large reported bet counts, though those counts do not measure economic value.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://stake.com/blog/birthday-wins-best-games-bet-bonuses","https://stake.com/blog/may-casino-sports-betting-highlights-stats"]},{"decision":"Restrict prohibited jurisdictions and use operator-controlled KYC and account custody.","consequence":"Centralized controls support compliance and service delivery but create account, custody and jurisdiction-dependent access risk.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://stake.com/policies/terms","https://www.gamblingcommission.gov.uk/news/article/consumer-information-notice-stake-leaving-gb-market"]}],"counterfactual":{"summary":"Without proprietary Originals and the casino/sportsbook bundle, Stake likely would have had weaker differentiation and retention. This is an inference; the reviewed sources do not provide controlled product-cohort evidence.","confidence":"low","source_refs":["https://stake.com/blog/birthday-wins-best-games-bet-bonuses","https://stake.com/blog/june-casino-sports-betting-highlights-stats"]},"watch":[{"signal":"The next Curaçao Gaming Authority registry entry for OGL/2024/1451/0918.","implication":"It should resolve whether assessment results in renewal, refusal or another status after the listed expiry.","source_refs":["https://gamingcontrol.spin-cdn.com/media/license_registry/20260626_20260626_ogl_license_registry.pdf"]},{"signal":"Monthly casino bet counts under an unchanged reporting definition.","implication":"Persistent multi-billion counts support operational durability; a structural break may indicate product, geography or reporting changes.","source_refs":["https://stake.com/blog/may-casino-sp